# Shell scripts must keep Unix (LF) line endings regardless of the
# committing/checking-out platform's Git config — a shell script with
# Windows (CRLF) line endings fails inside a Linux container with a
# cryptic "no such file or directory" error that doesn't obviously
# point at line endings as the cause. This matters concretely for
# docker/entrypoint.sh, added in Phase 10 to run migrations
# automatically on container startup.
*.sh text eol=lf
